Was that the last thing you filled in?  For better or worse, the software recognizes the first letter of a rebus as the complete entry.  So when you added the U, the software considered the puzzle finish.  
A way to prevent this from happening is to leave a non-rebus square empty until you've the entire puzzle solved to your satisfaction and then put that letter back.

